<title>UK: Osaka Gas prices $400 mln 10-year Eurobond, +41 bp.</title>
<headline>Osaka Gas prices $400 mln 10-year Eurobond, +41 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager Goldman Sachs International said Wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OSAKA GAS CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT	  $400 MLN  COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    07.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.642    PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	REOFFER    99.642    SPREAD	+41 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT U.S. TREASURY DUE 15.OCT.06 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
